    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "Mouse: drag a frame (also from its buttons), wheel to scroll, click the
    \u2261 handle. Keyboard/gamepad: arrows/d-pad or Tab choose, Enter/A goes in
    (frame \u2192 card \u2192 control; Enter presses a button, or starts/stops adjusting
    a slider), Esc/B comes back out. Page Up/Down, Home/End, F6 jumps to the next
    frame; Y toggles the drawer. Touch: everything above, plus the joystick (bottom
    right) with TouchController installed."
